{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111130","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1311113001:1":{"text":"이상하네요... 분명 나무를 베었는데... 전혀 베어지지가 않아요!","source_cn":"奇怪……明明满满每一剑都砍到那棵树了，可是根本砍不断它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D0ADA4BD07131D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311113002:1":{"text":"내 마법으로도 타지가 않아...","source_cn":"我的魔法也烧不掉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x537F21AF0630A7D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311113003:1":{"text":"돌아서 가도록 하자. 이 근처에 길이 하나 있었던 것 같은데... 그 길이...","source_cn":"我们绕路过去吧，我记得这附近还有一条路……那条路通往……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B55F11D596725A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311113004:1":{"text":"발리카?","source_cn":"瓦丽卡？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2998044E2306B666","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311113005:1":{"text":"통하는... 길이 하나 있을 텐데, 갑자기 생각이 안 나네... 이 숲에 대한 기억이 갑자기 희미해졌어...","source_cn":"通往……应该有一条路，但我突然想不起来了……对这片森林...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0C637CAF82BE417","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311113006:1":{"text":"어? 이게 어떻게 된 거지... 발리카까지...","source_cn":"诶？怎么回事……连瓦丽卡也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88006B99D484824A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1311113007:1":{"text":"어쩌면 이 숲도 시더 마을의 일 때문에 이상해졌을지도 몰라. 전에는 이런 상황을 겪었던 적이 없었거든.","source_cn":"或许这片森林也因为雪松镇的事情而变得不正常了，我之前从...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B34DD5CE409D8D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311113008:1":{"text":"타임 루프의 영향이 여기까지 미친 건 아니겠죠? 그렇다면 더 빨리 이 일을 해결해야겠어욥!","source_cn":"难道时间循环的余波影响到了这里？那我们更要快点解决这件...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x728A631299414A41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311113009:1":{"text":"우선은 그냥 상황을 봐가면서 이 길을 따라가 보자.","source_cn":"我倒是希望我说错了，现在走一步看一步吧。我们沿这边走下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DB826C3FC29E68B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"발리카","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}}